 "patterns": "This chunk covers hexagrams 25–46 (无妄 to 升), read through the 彖传, 大象 and 小象 (an AI reading of each). Most lines are 小象 glosses that explain a line's 吉凶 by a word or by its place, and have no general structure. The most frequent structure is explaining fortune by where a line sits: 中, 当位/位不当, 应, 上穷. The Hexagram modules make this kind of place relation exact (定域), but the fortune verdict cannot be derived from place alone.\n\nAgreements:\n- dependence (依存): 离=丽, 日月丽乎天, 草木丽乎土, 栋挠本末弱;\n- supply from beyond: 益自外来;\n- generation through encounter: 天地相遇品物咸章;\n- difference with shared change: the 睽 彖, 异而事同/志通/事类, already on the RO map;\n- observing what gathers to read the pattern of the whole: 观其所聚见天地万物之情;\n- a new growth without support cannot last: 枯杨生华;\n- acting at the juncture before the turn: 闲有家志未变;\n- the consequence falls back on one's own act: 自我致戎.\n\nStrongest divergences:\n- fixed gender places, and roles ranked by name, called 天地之大义: the 家人 彖, 男女正位, 父父子子, 严君;\n- order spread from one center: 正家而天下定, 后施命诰四方;\n- the 恒 小象: 从一而终, 夫子制义;\n- a prior will or command as the ground: 天之命, 天命不佑, 顺天命. These are the 'fixed nature / rank / single center / prior ground' layers.",
